Object.assign(window.__CMPDATA__=window.__CMPDATA__||{},{"qdrant__38": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（按ID/过滤器删除；快照残留）。 支持按 ID 或过滤器删除 point，无原生擦除证明 官方文档 快照备份保留被删 point 的历史状态 官方文档 WAL / 共识日志窗口期内可恢复 社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（按ID/过滤器删除；快照残留）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>支持按 ID 或过滤器删除 point，无原生擦除证明 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>快照备份保留被删 point 的历史状态 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>WAL / 共识日志窗口期内可恢复 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Delete by ID/filter; snapshot residue). Points can be deleted by ID or filter; no native erasure attestation <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> Snapshot backups retain historical s…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Delete by ID/filter; snapshot residue).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Points can be deleted by ID or filter; no native erasure attestation <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Snapshot backups retain historical states of deleted points <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>WAL / consensus logs are recoverable inside their windows <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "qdrant__39": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（查证为无原生血缘）。 无原生数据血缘 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（查证为无原生血缘）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无原生数据血缘 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (Verified: no native lineage). No native data lineage <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (Verified: no native lineage).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No native data lineage <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "qdrant__4": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持——collection snapshot 与 full snapshot API 完整：创建、列出、下载、上传、恢复（snapshots/upload、snapshots/recover，支持 URL 直恢复、checksum 校验与 snapshot 优先级参数）；单机可在启动时经 CLI --snapshot 恢复（官方明确…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>——collection snapshot 与 full snapshot API 完整：创建、列出、下载、上传、恢复（<code>snapshots/upload</code>、<code>snapshots/recover</code>，支持 URL 直恢复、checksum 校验与 snapshot 优先级参数）；单机可在启动时经 CLI <code>--snapshot</code> 恢复（官方明确不适用于多节点部署与 Cloud）；分片级恢复要求分片配置（shard_number 等）严格一致。<strong>不提供</strong>数据库原生连续 PITR：快照是时点备份，RPO 缺口通常要从事实主库重放并重新 embedding 补齐。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> + 社区 restore runbook 实测。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported — full collection-snapshot and full-snapshot APIs: create, list, download, upload, recover (snapshots/upload, snapshots/recover, with direct-from-URL …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> — full collection-snapshot and full-snapshot APIs: create, list, download, upload, recover (<code>snapshots/upload</code>, <code>snapshots/recover</code>, with direct-from-URL recovery, checksum verification, and snapshot-priority parameters); single-node clusters can recover at startup via the CLI <code>--snapshot</code> flag (officially not applicable to multi-node deployments or Cloud); shard-level recovery requires strictly matching shard configuration. <strong>No</strong> native continuous PITR: snapshots are point-in-time backups, and the RPO gap usually has to be replayed from the system of record and re-embedded. Evidence: official docs + community restore runbooks (field-tested).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "qdrant__40": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（存算一体：本地盘 mmap）。 数据存本地（mmap），存算一体 官方文档。 分布式模式分片仍在节点本地 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（存算一体：本地盘 mmap）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>数据存本地（mmap），存算一体 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>分布式模式分片仍在节点本地 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Coupled: local-disk mmap). Data on local disks (mmap); coupled <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Distributed-mode shards stay node-local <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Coupled: local-disk mmap).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Data on local disks (mmap); coupled <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Distributed-mode shards stay node-local <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "qdrant__41": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（纯向量+payload 过滤）。 纯向量检索引擎，payload 仅作过滤 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（纯向量+payload 过滤）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>纯向量检索引擎，payload 仅作过滤 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (Pure vectors + payload filtering). Pure vector search engine; payloads for filtering only <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (Pure vectors + payload filtering).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Pure vector search engine; payloads for filtering only <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "qdrant__42": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用（自建无计费，成本=硬件+人力自理）。 开源自建无内置计费概念，成本是节点硬件、存储与运维人力。社区共识 Qdrant Cloud 托管版按量计费，支持用量视图。厂商口径</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>（自建无计费，成本=硬件+人力自理）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>开源自建无内置计费概念，成本是节点硬件、存储与运维人力。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>Qdrant Cloud 托管版按量计费，支持用量视图。<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A (No metering; hardware plus labor). Self-hosted open source has no built-in metering; costs are node hardware, storage, and operations labor. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span> Qd…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> (No metering; hardware plus labor).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Self-hosted open source has no built-in metering; costs are node hardware, storage, and operations labor. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>Qdrant Cloud managed edition meters usage with usage views. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "qdrant__43": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（Python/Rust/TS/Go 官方客户端）。 官方 Python/Rust/TypeScript/Go 客户端 官方文档。 REST/gRPC 双接口 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（Python/Rust/TS/Go 官方客户端）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>官方 Python/Rust/TypeScript/Go 客户端 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>REST/gRPC 双接口 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Official Python/Rust/TS/Go clients). Official Python/Rust/TypeScript/Go clients <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Dual REST/gRPC APIs <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Official Python/Rust/TS/Go clients).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Official Python/Rust/TypeScript/Go clients <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Dual REST/gRPC APIs <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "qdrant__44": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用（向量库无物化视图概念）。 无物化视图概念（不适用）官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>（向量库无物化视图概念）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无物化视图概念（不适用）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A (No MV concept). No materialized-view concept (N/A) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> (No MV concept).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No materialized-view concept (N/A) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "qdrant__45": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（开源任意云；Qdrant Cloud 多云）。 开源版任意云可部署 官方文档。 Qdrant Cloud 支持多云 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（开源任意云；Qdrant Cloud 多云）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>开源版任意云可部署 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Qdrant Cloud 支持多云 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Open source on any cloud; Qdrant Cloud multi-cloud). Open source deploys on any cloud <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Qdrant Cloud supports multiple clouds <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Open source on any cloud; Qdrant Cloud multi-cloud).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open source deploys on any cloud <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Qdrant Cloud supports multiple clouds <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "qdrant__46": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（幂等 upsert 按分片串行，持续小批量拖垮优化器）。 更新原语是按 point ID 的幂等 upsert（删+插，v1.17 起支持 insert-only/update-only 模式）；写先入分片 WAL 保证崩溃可恢复与幂等重放，每个分片有独立更新 worker 做串行化 厂商口径。 除整行删插外，还提供 updat…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（幂等 upsert 按分片串行，持续小批量拖垮优化器）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>更新原语是按 point ID 的幂等 upsert（删+插，v1.17 起支持 insert-only/update-only 模式）；写先入分片 WAL 保证崩溃可恢复与幂等重放，每个分片有独立更新 worker 做串行化 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>除整行删插外，还提供 update_vectors（按 point 只更新部分向量）与 update payload（只改标量载荷、不触及向量索引）等局部更新接口；纯载荷的热点更新可借此避开向量重建开销 <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。</li>\n<li>同 point 并发 upsert 按分片 WAL 顺序串行执行，后写覆盖，无冲突报错、无内核重试；跨分片/副本的顺序一致性需应用自行保证 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>衰减形态是段优化器抖动：持续的单点小批量 upsert 让后台索引构建循环永不收敛，CPU 被优化器打满；批量 upsert（500–2000 点一批）是社区公认解法 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>无专属热点机制；optimizers_config 可调（indexing_threshold_kb 默认 20MB、default_segment_number 等）但属于常规调参，非热点开关 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>推荐模式：批量 upsert、分片拆分（3–12 分片，各分片独立更新 worker）分散写入压力；代价是批量窗口的延迟、调参复杂度，以及分片过多带来的查询扇出成本 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (idempotent upserts serialize per shard; sustained tiny batches thrash the optimizer). The update primitive is idempotent upsert by point ID (delete-p…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (idempotent upserts serialize per shard; sustained tiny batches thrash the optimizer).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The update primitive is idempotent upsert by point ID (delete-plus-insert; update modes for insert-only or update-only since v1.17); writes go through the shard WAL first for crash recovery and idempotent replay, and each shard has an independent update worker that serializes them <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>Beyond full delete-plus-insert, partial-update interfaces exist: update_vectors (updates only selected vectors of a point) and update payload (changes only scalar payload, leaving the vector index untouched); payload-only hotspot updates can thereby avoid vector-index rebuild costs (to be verified).</li>\n<li>Concurrent upserts on the same point execute serially in shard WAL order with last-write-wins — no conflict errors, no kernel retry; ordering consistency across shards/replicas must be ensured by the application <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>The decay pattern is segment-optimizer thrashing: sustained small single-point upserts keep the background index-build loop perpetually active and pin CPU at 100%; batched upserts (500–2,000 points per batch) are the community-accepted fix <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>There is no dedicated hotspot mechanism; <code>optimizers_config</code> is tunable (<code>indexing_threshold_kb</code> default 20MB, <code>default_segment_number</code>, etc.) but that is routine tuning, not a hotspot switch <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>Recommended patterns: batched upserts and sharding (3–12 shards, each with an independent update worker) to spread write pressure; the cost is batch-window latency, tuning complexity, and query fan-out cost from too many shards <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "qdrant__5": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——Prometheus /metrics（v1.17 起含 REST/gRPC 响应指标，v1.18 支持 ?per_collection=true 增加 collection 标签）、cluster-wide telemetry API、segment optimization monitoring、v1.18 按组件拆分的集合 R…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>——Prometheus <code>/metrics</code>（v1.17 起含 REST/gRPC 响应指标，v1.18 支持 <code>?per_collection=true</code> 增加 collection 标签）、cluster-wide telemetry API、segment optimization monitoring、v1.18 按组件拆分的集合 RAM/磁盘/page cache 用量；<code>/healthz</code> <code>/readyz</code> <code>/livez</code> 健康检查；Web UI / Dashboard 可查看集合与资源状态。证据：官方发布文章（v1.17/v1.18）+ 官方文档。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — Prometheus /metrics (REST/gRPC response metrics since v1.17; v1.18 supports ?per_collection=true adding collection labels), cluster-wide telemetry API, segmen…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> — Prometheus <code>/metrics</code> (REST/gRPC response metrics since v1.17; v1.18 supports <code>?per_collection=true</code> adding collection labels), cluster-wide telemetry API, segment optimization monitoring, per-component collection RAM/disk/page-cache breakdown in v1.18; <code>/healthz</code> <code>/readyz</code> <code>/livez</code> health checks; Web UI / Dashboard for collection and resource status. Evidence: official release posts (v1.17/v1.18) + official docs.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "qdrant__6": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——HTTP REST（默认 6333）与 gRPC（默认 6334）双协议；无状态 API，没有数据库 session/连接事务模型；客户端复用 HTTP 连接，gRPC 在批量操作上更快（社区实测口径）。证据：官方文档 + 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>——HTTP REST（默认 6333）与 gRPC（默认 6334）双协议；无状态 API，没有数据库 session/连接事务模型；客户端复用 HTTP 连接，gRPC 在批量操作上更快（社区实测口径）。证据：官方文档 + 社区共识。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — HTTP REST (default 6333) and gRPC (default 6334); stateless APIs with no database session/connection-transaction model; clients reuse HTTP connections, gRPC i…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> — HTTP REST (default 6333) and gRPC (default 6334); stateless APIs with no database session/connection-transaction model; clients reuse HTTP connections, gRPC is faster for bulk operations (community-measured). Evidence: official docs + community consensus.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "qdrant__7": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用——无 SQL 隔离级别与多记录跨点 ACID 事务；官方明确不以强事务保证为目标。点级写入有自身的 WAL/version 语义（同 ID upsert 为原子覆盖），跨点一致性通过复制因子与 write consistency 参数调节，见&quot;复制与一致性&quot;。证据：官方分布式文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>——无 SQL 隔离级别与多记录跨点 ACID 事务；官方明确不以强事务保证为目标。点级写入有自身的 WAL/version 语义（同 ID upsert 为原子覆盖），跨点一致性通过复制因子与 write consistency 参数调节，见&quot;复制与一致性&quot;。证据：官方分布式文档。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A — no SQL isola</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A — no SQL isolation levels and no multi-record cross-point ACID transactions; officially not designed around strong transactional guarantees. Point-level writes have t…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> — no SQL isolation levels and no multi-record cross-point ACID transactions; officially not designed around strong transactional guarantees. Point-level writes have their own WAL/version semantics (same-ID upsert is an atomic overwrite); cross-point consistency is tuned via replication factor and write-consistency parameters — see &quot;Replication &amp; consistency&quot;. Evidence: official distributed docs.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "qdrant__8": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持——两层模型：集群拓扑与 collection 结构元数据走 Raft 强一致；point 数据（upsert/search/delete）不走 Raft 共识，走可配置的 replication factor、write consistency factor 与 weak/medium/strong ordering。默认倾向低…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>——两层模型：集群拓扑与 collection 结构元数据走 Raft 强一致；point 数据（upsert/search/delete）<strong>不走</strong> Raft 共识，走可配置的 replication factor、write consistency factor 与 weak/medium/strong ordering。默认倾向低延迟/可用性；集群选主或过渡状态下 collection 结构更新可能被拒绝。注意：这里的&quot;strong ordering&quot;不等于 SQL 的 serializable 事务。证据：官方分布式文档。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported — two-tier model: cluster topology and collection-structure metadata go through Raft with strong consistency; point data (upsert/search/delete) does n…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> — two-tier model: cluster topology and collection-structure metadata go through Raft with strong consistency; point data (upsert/search/delete) does <strong>not</strong> go through Raft consensus, using configurable replication factor, write consistency factor, and weak/medium/strong ordering instead. Defaults favor low latency/availability; collection-structure updates can be rejected during leader elections or transitional states. Note: &quot;strong ordering&quot; here is not SQL serializable. Evidence: official distributed docs.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "qdrant__9": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——collection 由一个或多个 shard 组成；自动分片使用一致性哈希，v1.7.0 起支持 user-defined sharding / shard key；副本用于提升读吞吐。扩容需要 shard 移动、复制或 resharding，消耗磁盘与网络并带来查询 fan-out，&quot;加节点&quot;不等于&quot;立即线性加速&quot;。证据：官方文…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>——collection 由一个或多个 shard 组成；自动分片使用一致性哈希，v1.7.0 起支持 user-defined sharding / shard key；副本用于提升读吞吐。扩容需要 shard 移动、复制或 resharding，消耗磁盘与网络并带来查询 fan-out，&quot;加节点&quot;不等于&quot;立即线性加速&quot;。证据：官方文档 + 社区共识。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — a collection consists of one or more shards; automatic sharding uses consistent hashing, user-defined sharding / shard keys since v1.7.0; replicas scale read …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> — a collection consists of one or more shards; automatic sharding uses consistent hashing, user-defined sharding / shard keys since v1.7.0; replicas scale read throughput. Scaling out requires shard moves, replication, or resharding, consuming disk and network and adding query fan-out — &quot;adding nodes&quot; is not &quot;instant linear speedup&quot;. Evidence: official docs + community consensus.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__0": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">查证为无</span><p class=\"snippet\">查证为无<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。无内置 TDE；云托管由云厂商提供盘级加密<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>查证为无</strong><span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。无内置 TDE；云托管由云厂商提供盘级加密<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">confirmed absent</span><p class=\"snippet\">confirmed absent <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. No built-in TDE; cloud-managed offerings get disk-level encryption from the cloud provider <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>confirmed absent</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. No built-in TDE; cloud-managed offerings get disk-level encryption from the cloud provider <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__1": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。TLS 支持；Valkey 8.1 宣称 I/O 线程卸载后 TLS 建连接速率提升约 300%（Linux 基金会新闻稿口径，厂商口径）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。TLS 支持；Valkey 8.1 宣称 I/O 线程卸载后 TLS 建连接速率提升约 300%（Linux 基金会新闻稿口径，厂商口径）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. TLS supported; Valkey 8.1 claims TLS connection establishment rate improved ~300% after offloading to I/O threads (Linux Foundation press relea…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. TLS supported; Valkey 8.1 claims TLS connection establishment rate improved ~300% after offloading to I/O threads (Linux Foundation press release statement, vendor claim).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__10": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。RESP2/RESP3 协议；Redis ↔ Valkey 在 7.2 基线前命令/行为一致，此后新特性互不覆盖；全语言客户端（Jedis/Lettuce/ioredis/redis-py/go-redis 等）对两者通用。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。RESP2/RESP3 协议；Redis ↔ Valkey 在 7.2 基线前命令/行为一致，此后新特性互不覆盖；全语言客户端（Jedis/Lettuce/ioredis/redis-py/go-redis 等）对两者通用。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (official docs / community consensus). RESP2/RESP3 protocol; Redis ↔ Valkey identical in commands/behavior up to the 7.2 baseline, new features on each side not…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (official docs / community consensus). RESP2/RESP3 protocol; Redis ↔ Valkey identical in commands/behavior up to the 7.2 baseline, new features on each side not covered by the other afterwards; full-language clients (Jedis/Lettuce/ioredis/redis-py/go-redis, etc.) work with both.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__11": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（官方公告/第三方口径）。Redis 2024-03 转 RSALv2/SSPLv1，2025-05 起三许可（AGPLv3 可选其一）；Valkey 为 Linux 基金会 BSD-3 fork。商业模式：自建免费；云托管按内存/规格计费——内存成本主导一切，ElastiCache for Valkey 约比 Redis OSS 便宜…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（官方公告/第三方口径）。Redis 2024-03 转 RSALv2/SSPLv1，2025-05 起三许可（AGPLv3 可选其一）；Valkey 为 Linux 基金会 BSD-3 fork。商业模式：自建免费；云托管按内存/规格计费——内存成本主导一切，ElastiCache for Valkey 约比 Redis OSS 便宜 20%（Upstash 2026-06 定价对比博客，第三方口径）；TB 级全内存是&quot;用钱换延迟&quot;。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (official announcements / third-party statements). Redis moved to RSALv2/SSPLv1 in 2024-03 and has been triple-licensed since 2025-05 (AGPLv3 as one option); Va…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (official announcements / third-party statements). Redis moved to RSALv2/SSPLv1 in 2024-03 and has been triple-licensed since 2025-05 (AGPLv3 as one option); Valkey is a Linux Foundation BSD-3 fork. Business model: self-hosted is free; cloud-managed billed by memory/spec — memory cost dominates everything; ElastiCache for Valkey is roughly 20% cheaper than Redis OSS (Upstash 2026-06 pricing comparison blog, third-party statement); terabyte-scale all-in-memory is &quot;buying latency with money.&quot;</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__12": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有中文社区翻译</span><p class=\"snippet\">丰富<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。官方文档有中文社区翻译；CSDN/掘金/知乎大量实战帖。 补充维度（非固定题库，供选型参考） 存储引擎：纯内存 + 可选持久化（RDB 快照 / AOF 日志，7.0+ 为多文件 AOF manifest）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> 部署形态：自建（单机 / Sentinel / Cluster）、容器、云托管；云厂商托管产品线已分化…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>丰富</strong><span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。官方文档有中文社区翻译；CSDN/掘金/知乎大量实战帖。</p>\n<p><strong>补充维度（非固定题库，供选型参考）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>存储引擎</strong>：纯内存 + 可选持久化（RDB 快照 / AOF 日志，7.0+ 为多文件 AOF manifest）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li><strong>部署形态</strong>：自建（单机 / Sentinel / Cluster）、容器、云托管；云厂商托管产品线已分化（部分转 Valkey）<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li><strong>运维复杂度</strong>：单机低（&quot;装完基本不用管&quot;是口碑来源）；Sentinel 中；Cluster 中高（slot 迁移、客户端路由）<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Rich</span><p class=\"snippet\">Rich <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Official docs have a community Chinese translation; large volumes of hands-on posts on CSDN, Juejin, Zhihu. Supplementary dimensions (not part…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Rich</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Official docs have a community Chinese translation; large volumes of hands-on posts on CSDN, Juejin, Zhihu.</p>\n<p><strong>Supplementary dimensions (not part of the fixed battery, for selection reference)</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Storage engine</strong>: Pure in-memory + optional persistence (RDB snapshots / AOF log; multi-file AOF manifest since 7.0) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li><strong>Deployment modes</strong>: Self-hosted (single node / Sentinel / Cluster), containers, cloud-managed; cloud vendors&#x27; managed product lines have diverged (some shifting to Valkey) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li><strong>Operational complexity</strong>: Low for single node (&quot;install and forget&quot; is the source of its reputation); medium for Sentinel; medium-high for Cluster (slot migration, client-side routing) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__13": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（内存级亚毫秒 P99；大 key/热 key 是瓶颈）。 单 key 操作亚毫秒 P99；Redis 单线程命令执行（7.0+ IO 多线程），Valkey 持续多线程化 社区共识。 Cluster 分片扩展吞吐；大 key（慢操作阻塞）、热 key（单分片）是瓶颈 社区共识。 持久化（AOF/RDB）与复制对尾延迟有影响，fork …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（内存级亚毫秒 P99；大 key/热 key 是瓶颈）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>单 key 操作亚毫秒 P99；Redis 单线程命令执行（7.0+ IO 多线程），Valkey 持续多线程化 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>Cluster 分片扩展吞吐；大 key（慢操作阻塞）、热 key（单分片）是瓶颈 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>持久化（AOF/RDB）与复制对尾延迟有影响，fork 时的延迟毛刺是经典问题 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>第三方 ZSET 写入基准（Momento，2026-09）：同机 r8g.4xlarge 上 5000 万成员 sorted set、pipelined ZADD NX 写入，Valkey 9.1.2 中位插入 647k/s（十轮 643–652k/s）、内存 3.34 GB（~67 字节/member）；Redis 8.10.2 为 632k/s（十轮 628–639k/s）、3.73 GB（~75 字节/member）。Valkey 内存少约 10%，吞吐小幅领先（两版本十轮区间无重叠，但差距仅约 2.4%）。注意：Momento 是 Valkey 生态厂商（托管 Valkey 服务），基准有立场；方法局限：单 ZSET 负载、短成员、整数分数、单 pipelined 客户端，结论不代表通用混合负载 <code>第三方口径</code>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (in-memory sub-millisecond P99; big keys/hot keys are the bottleneck). Sub-millisecond P99 on single-key ops; Redis single-threaded command execution (7.0+ mult…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (in-memory sub-millisecond P99; big keys/hot keys are the bottleneck).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Sub-millisecond P99 on single-key ops; Redis single-threaded command execution (7.0+ multi-threaded I/O), Valkey pushing multi-threading further <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Cluster sharding scales throughput; big keys (blocking slow ops) and hot keys (single shard) are the bottlenecks <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Persistence (AOF/RDB) and replication affect tail latency; fork-time latency spikes are the classic issue <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Third-party sorted-set write benchmark (Momento, 2026-09): 50M-member ZSET via pipelined ZADD NX on an r8g.4xlarge — Valkey 9.1.2 median inserts 647k/s (643–652k/s across ten runs), memory 3.34 GB (~67 bytes/member); Redis 8.10.2 median 632k/s (628–639k/s), 3.73 GB (~75 bytes/member). Valkey uses ~10% less memory with a small throughput edge (no overlap across ten runs, but the gap is only ~2.4%). Note: Momento is a Valkey-ecosystem vendor (managed Valkey services), so the benchmark carries a position; method limits: single ZSET workload, short members, integer scores, one pipelined client — not a general mixed-workload result <code>(third-party statement)</code>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__14": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（开源无官方认证；Redis 企业版有）。 Redis 开源版/Valkey：无官方合规认证，合规责任在部署方 社区共识。 Redis Enterprise（Redis Inc）：SOC2 等企业合规<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>厂商口径。 各云厂商托管 Redis 继承云厂商资质 厂商口径。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（开源无官方认证；Redis 企业版有）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Redis 开源版/Valkey：无官方合规认证，合规责任在部署方 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>Redis Enterprise（Redis Inc）：SOC2 等企业合规<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span><span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>各云厂商托管 Redis 继承云厂商资质 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (no official certs for open source; Redis Enterprise certified). Open-source Redis / Valkey: no official compliance certs; deployer responsible (commu…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (no official certs for open source; Redis Enterprise certified).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open-source Redis / Valkey: no official compliance certs; deployer responsible <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Redis Enterprise (Redis Inc.): SOC2 and enterprise compliance <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span> <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>Cloud-managed Redis offerings inherit provider qualifications <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__15": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（2009 年诞生；2024 年许可风波后分叉）。 Redis 2009 年由 Salvatore Sanfilippo 发布；2024 年改 RSALv2/SSPL，Valkey fork 并入 Linux 基金会 社区共识。 redis/redis GitHub stars 数万级（历史积累），Valkey 从零快速追赶 社区共识。…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（2009 年诞生；2024 年许可风波后分叉）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Redis 2009 年由 Salvatore Sanfilippo 发布；2024 年改 RSALv2/SSPL，Valkey fork 并入 Linux 基金会 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>redis/redis GitHub stars 数万级（历史积累），Valkey 从零快速追赶 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>选型需做许可尽调：Redis 7.4+ 不再是 OSI 开源 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (born 2009; forked after the 2024 license storm). Redis released 2009 by Salvatore Sanfilippo; the 2024 RSALv2/SSPL switch led to the Valkey fork under the Linu…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (born 2009; forked after the 2024 license storm).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Redis released 2009 by Salvatore Sanfilippo; the 2024 RSALv2/SSPL switch led to the Valkey fork under the Linux Foundation <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>redis/redis holds tens of thousands of stars (historical); Valkey catching up fast from zero <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Selection needs license due diligence: Redis 7.4+ is no longer OSI open source <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__16": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（Twitter/X、GitHub、Stack Overflow）。 Twitter/X、GitHub、Stack Overflow 等公开重度用户 社区共识。 几乎所有互联网公司的缓存/队列标配 社区共识。 Valkey：AWS/Google 等云厂商与 Linux 基金会背书，迁移案例增长中 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（Twitter/X、GitHub、Stack Overflow）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Twitter/X、GitHub、Stack Overflow 等公开重度用户 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>几乎所有互联网公司的缓存/队列标配 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>Valkey：AWS/Google 等云厂商与 Linux 基金会背书，迁移案例增长中 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Twitter/X, GitHub, Stack Overflow). Public heavy users: Twitter/X, GitHub, Stack Overflow <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. The default cache/queue at virtually every int…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Twitter/X, GitHub, Stack Overflow).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Public heavy users: Twitter/X, GitHub, Stack Overflow <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>The default cache/queue at virtually every internet company <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Valkey: backed by AWS/Google and the Linux Foundation; migration stories growing <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__17": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（redis-shake 迁移；备份靠 RDB/AOF）。 备份：RDB 快照/AOF；云托管版自动备份 社区共识。 迁移/同步：redis-shake（异构/跨云，社区共识）社区共识。 CDC：Debezium Redis 连接器；监控：redis_exporter 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（redis-shake 迁移；备份靠 RDB/AOF）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>备份：RDB 快照/AOF；云托管版自动备份 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>迁移/同步：redis-shake（异构/跨云，社区共识）<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>CDC：Debezium Redis 连接器；监控：redis_exporter <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (redis-shake migration; backup via RDB/AOF). Backup: RDB snapshots/AOF; managed editions automate it <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Migration/sync: redis-shake (heterog…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (redis-shake migration; backup via RDB/AOF).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Backup: RDB snapshots/AOF; managed editions automate it <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Migration/sync: redis-shake (heterogeneous/cross-cloud, community standard) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>CDC: Debezium Redis connector; monitoring: redis_exporter <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__18": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（Upstash 做 Serverless；各云托管全）。 Serverless：Upstash（按请求计费）社区共识。 各云托管（ElastiCache/MemoryDB/阿里云等）支持 Redis 与 Valkey 社区共识。 Redis Cloud（Redis Inc）企业级托管 厂商口径。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（Upstash 做 Serverless；各云托管全）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Serverless：Upstash（按请求计费）<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>各云托管（ElastiCache/MemoryDB/阿里云等）支持 Redis 与 Valkey <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>Redis Cloud（Redis Inc）企业级托管 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Upstash does serverless; hosted on every cloud). Serverless: Upstash (per-request billing) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Managed on every cloud (ElastiCache/MemoryDB/…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Upstash does serverless; hosted on every cloud).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Serverless: Upstash (per-request billing) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Managed on every cloud (ElastiCache/MemoryDB/Alibaba Cloud) for Redis and Valkey <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Redis Cloud (Redis Inc.) enterprise hosting <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__19": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（无专用批量工具；靠 --pipe/RESTORE/脚本）。 无官方 bulk load 工具；redis-cli --pipe 协议导入是常用土法 社区共识。 RESTORE/DUMP 做单 key 迁移；RDB 可做冷导入 官方文档。 大批量写入注意单线程阻塞，用 pipeline 拆批 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（无专用批量工具；靠 --pipe/RESTORE/脚本）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无官方 bulk load 工具；redis-cli --pipe 协议导入是常用土法 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>RESTORE/DUMP 做单 key 迁移；RDB 可做冷导入 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>大批量写入注意单线程阻塞，用 pipeline 拆批 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (No dedicated bulk tool; --pipe/RESTORE/scripts). No official bulk-load tool; redis-cli --pipe protocol import is the common workaround (community con…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (No dedicated bulk tool; --pipe/RESTORE/scripts).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No official bulk-load tool; redis-cli --pipe protocol import is the common workaround <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>RESTORE/DUMP for single-key moves; RDB for cold imports <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Large writes can block the single thread — split into pipelined batches <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__2": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。ACL 用户权限（Redis 6+）、SLOWLOG 慢查询；Valkey 8.1 新增 COMMANDLOG（全量命令历史）；无传统意义上的细粒度审计日志能力（查证为无）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。ACL 用户权限（Redis 6+）、SLOWLOG 慢查询；Valkey 8.1 新增 COMMANDLOG（全量命令历史）；无传统意义上的细粒度审计日志能力（查证为无）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (official docs / community consensus). ACL users and permissions (Redis 6+), SLOWLOG slow-query log; Valkey 8.1 adds COMMANDLOG (full command history)…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (official docs / community consensus). ACL users and permissions (Redis 6+), SLOWLOG slow-query log; Valkey 8.1 adds COMMANDLOG (full command history); no fine-grained audit-logging capability in the traditional sense (confirmed absent).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__20": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（无外部表/联邦查询）。 OSS 无外部数据访问语义 官方文档。 RedisGears 可写脚本调外部，但那是计算不是查询联邦 待验证。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（无外部表/联邦查询）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>OSS 无外部数据访问语义 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>RedisGears 可写脚本调外部，但那是计算不是查询联邦 <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (No external tables/federated queries). OSS has no external-data-access semantics <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. RedisGears scripts can call out, but that is compute, not…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (No external tables/federated queries).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>OSS has no external-data-access semantics <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>RedisGears scripts can call out, but that is compute, not query federation <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__21": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（Keyspace 通知+Stream，非标准 CDC）。 Keyspace notifications 可订阅变更事件，但不可靠（fire-and-forget）官方文档。 Redis Streams 可当 append-only 日志自己实现变更流 社区共识。 Debezium Redis 连接器多为 sink（写入）方向，s…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（Keyspace 通知+Stream，非标准 CDC）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Keyspace notifications 可订阅变更事件，但不可靠（fire-and-forget）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Redis Streams 可当 append-only 日志自己实现变更流 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>Debezium Redis 连接器多为 sink（写入）方向，source 侧弱 <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (Keyspace notifications + Streams; not standard CDC). Keyspace notifications subscribe to change events but are unreliable (fire-and-forget) (official…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (Keyspace notifications + Streams; not standard CDC).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Keyspace notifications subscribe to change events but are unreliable (fire-and-forget) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Redis Streams can serve as an append-only log for a hand-rolled change feed <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>The Debezium Redis connector is mostly a sink (write) direction; source side is weak <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__22": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（EXPIRE/TTL 原生，键级精确过期）。 EXPIRE/PEXPIRE/EXPIREAT 精确到毫秒，后台+惰性双删策略 官方文档。 大量 key 同时过期可能引发延迟毛刺，生产上打散过期时间是常识 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（EXPIRE/TTL 原生，键级精确过期）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>EXPIRE/PEXPIRE/EXPIREAT 精确到毫秒，后台+惰性双删策略 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>大量 key 同时过期可能引发延迟毛刺，生产上打散过期时间是常识 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Native EXPIRE/TTL; exact per-key expiry). EXPIRE/PEXPIRE/EXPIREAT with millisecond precision; active + lazy expiry <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Mass simultaneous expiries …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Native EXPIRE/TTL; exact per-key expiry).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>EXPIRE/PEXPIRE/EXPIREAT with millisecond precision; active + lazy expiry <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Mass simultaneous expiries can cause latency spikes — scattering expiry times is standard practice <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__23": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用（无 schema，无 DDL）。 KV/数据结构无 schema，无 DDL 概念 官方文档。 RediSearch 索引 schema 变更需重建 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>（无 schema，无 DDL）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>KV/数据结构无 schema，无 DDL 概念 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>RediSearch 索引 schema 变更需重建 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A (No schema, no DDL). KV/data structures have no schema and no DDL concept <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. RediSearch index schema changes need rebuilds <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> (No schema, no DDL).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>KV/data structures have no schema and no DDL concept <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>RediSearch index schema changes need rebuilds <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__24": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（db 编号逻辑隔离；无资源限流）。 select db 编号做逻辑隔离，无 CPU/内存限流，一个租户可打满 社区共识。 生产多租户靠多实例/分片，Redis Cluster 的 db 编号还受限 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（db 编号逻辑隔离；无资源限流）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>select db 编号做逻辑隔离，无 CPU/内存限流，一个租户可打满 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>生产多租户靠多实例/分片，Redis Cluster 的 db 编号还受限 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (DB-number logical isolation; no resource throttling). SELECT db-number for logical isolation; no CPU/memory throttling — one tenant can saturate (community conse…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (DB-number logical isolation; no resource throttling).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>SELECT db-number for logical isolation; no CPU/memory throttling — one tenant can saturate <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Production multi-tenancy means multiple instances/shards; db numbers are even restricted in Redis Cluster <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__25": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（企业版 Active-Active（CRDT）；开源无）。 Redis Enterprise Active-Active 用 CRDT 做多活写，开源版无 厂商口径。 开源跨区靠主从复制，写单点 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（企业版 Active-Active（CRDT）；开源无）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Redis Enterprise Active-Active 用 CRDT 做多活写，开源版无 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>开源跨区靠主从复制，写单点 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Enterprise Active-Active (CRDT); not in open source). Redis Enterprise Active-Active uses CRDTs for multi-writer; absent in open source <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>. Open-sour…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Enterprise Active-Active (CRDT); not in open source).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Redis Enterprise Active-Active uses CRDTs for multi-writer; absent in open source <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>Open-source cross-region relies on primary-replica; single write point <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__26": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（Sentinel/Cluster 秒级切换）。 Sentinel 自动故障转移秒级，Cluster 分片主从自动切 官方文档。 异步复制下切换可能丢数（RPO 非零），等 Valkey 的改进 社区共识。 脑裂时旧主写入成幽灵数据，客户端要处理 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（Sentinel/Cluster 秒级切换）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Sentinel 自动故障转移秒级，Cluster 分片主从自动切 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>异步复制下切换可能丢数（RPO 非零），等 Valkey 的改进 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>脑裂时旧主写入成幽灵数据，客户端要处理 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Sentinel/Cluster failover in seconds). Sentinel auto-failover in seconds; Cluster shard primaries fail over automatically <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Async replication ca…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Sentinel/Cluster failover in seconds).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Sentinel auto-failover in seconds; Cluster shard primaries fail over automatically <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Async replication can lose data on failover (non-zero RPO); await Valkey improvements <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Split-brain writes to the old primary become ghost data; clients must cope <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__27": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（无行列概念；靠ACL隔离）。 Redis / Valkey 是 KV 存储，无行 / 列概念，原生无 RLS 与列级权限 官方文档 ACL 可按 key 模式与命令做权限隔离，是唯一的原生隔离手段 官方文档 脱敏只能在应用层做；key 命名规范决定 ACL 策略能否落地 社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（无行列概念；靠ACL隔离）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Redis / Valkey 是 KV 存储，无行 / 列概念，原生无 RLS 与列级权限 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>ACL 可按 key 模式与命令做权限隔离，是唯一的原生隔离手段 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>脱敏只能在应用层做；key 命名规范决定 ACL 策略能否落地 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (No row/column concept; ACL isolation only). Redis / Valkey is a KV store with no row/column concept; natively no RLS or column privileges <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> A…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (No row/column concept; ACL isolation only).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Redis / Valkey is a KV store with no row/column concept; natively no RLS or column privileges <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>ACLs isolate by key pattern and command; that is the only native isolation mechanism <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Masking can only happen in the app layer; key-naming discipline decides whether ACL policy is enforceable <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__28": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（RedisJSON 模块；原生无）。 RedisJSON（ReJSON）模块提供 JSON 类型与路径查询，Valkey 兼容 官方文档。 模块非内核，云厂商支持度不一 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（RedisJSON 模块；原生无）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>RedisJSON（ReJSON）模块提供 JSON 类型与路径查询，Valkey 兼容 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>模块非内核，云厂商支持度不一 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (RedisJSON module; not native). RedisJSON module for JSON types and path queries; Valkey-compatible <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Module, not core; cloud support varies (commu…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (RedisJSON module; not native).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>RedisJSON module for JSON types and path queries; Valkey-compatible <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Module, not core; cloud support varies <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__29": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（RediSearch 模块；中文分词弱）。 RediSearch 模块全文检索+聚合 官方文档。 中文分词弱，内存占用高 社区实测。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（RediSearch 模块；中文分词弱）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>RediSearch 模块全文检索+聚合 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>中文分词弱，内存占用高 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (RediSearch module; weak CJK). RediSearch module for full-text + aggregations <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Weak Chinese tokenization; high memory (community tested).</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (RediSearch module; weak CJK).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>RediSearch module for full-text + aggregations <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Weak Chinese tokenization; high memory <code>(community tested)</code>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__3": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。AUTH / ACL（Redis 6+）；Valkey 第二发行版支持 LDAP（ODBMS 对 Madelyn Olson 访谈，2025-06）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。AUTH / ACL（Redis 6+）；Valkey 第二发行版支持 LDAP（ODBMS 对 Madelyn Olson 访谈，2025-06）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. AUTH / ACL (Redis 6+); Valkey supports LDAP from its second release (ODBMS interview with Madelyn Olson, 2025-06).</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. AUTH / ACL (Redis 6+); Valkey supports LDAP from its second release (ODBMS interview with Madelyn Olson, 2025-06).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__30": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（内存型；靠紧凑对象编码省内存）。 Redis/Valkey 为内存数据库，压缩主要靠对象编码优化：listpack、intset、ziplist 等紧凑结构。官方文档 无通用数据压缩算法，大 value 场景内存占用高，需应用层自行压缩。社区实测 RDB/AOF 持久化文件可配置压缩，但属备份范畴不计入本维度。官方文档 ZSET…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（内存型；靠紧凑对象编码省内存）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Redis/Valkey 为内存数据库，压缩主要靠对象编码优化：listpack、intset、ziplist 等紧凑结构。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>无通用数据压缩算法，大 value 场景内存占用高，需应用层自行压缩。<span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span></li>\n<li>RDB/AOF 持久化文件可配置压缩，但属备份范畴不计入本维度。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>ZSET 内存演进（Momento 2026-09 第三方基准交叉印证）：Valkey PR #1427（2025-01 合并、8.1 发布）重构 sorted set 哈希表使其直指 skiplist 节点，PR #2508（2025-11 合并、9.1 发布）将成员字符串嵌入 skiplist 节点；Redis PR #14701 于一年零十天后（2026-01 合并、8.6 发布）移植了 #1427（PR 说明明确标注来源），但保留自家 dict 而未采用 Valkey 新哈希表。实测：Redis 8.6 的 3.73 GB 与 Valkey 8.1 的 3.77 GB 基本持平，同代插入吞吐 Redis 8.6.7（613k/s）实际高于 Valkey 8.1.10（590k/s）；Valkey 9.1.2 的 3.34 GB（~67 字节/member）为当前最小，Redis 8.10.2 为 3.73 GB（~75 字节/member）。基准方为 Valkey 生态厂商，有立场；负载为单一 ZSET 写入场景 <code>第三方口径</code>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (In-memory; saves RAM via compact object encodings). Redis/Valkey are in-memory databases; compression comes mainly from object-encoding optimizations: listpack, …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (In-memory; saves RAM via compact object encodings).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Redis/Valkey are in-memory databases; compression comes mainly from object-encoding optimizations: listpack, intset, ziplist and other compact structures. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>No general-purpose data compression; large-value workloads use significant RAM and need application-layer compression. <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n<li>RDB/AOF persistence files support compression, but that is backup-scope and excluded from this dimension. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>ZSET memory evolution (cross-verified by Momento&#x27;s 2026-09 third-party benchmark): Valkey PR #1427 (merged 2025-01, shipped in 8.1) restructured the sorted-set hash table to point directly at skiplist nodes; PR #2508 (merged 2025-11, shipped in 9.1) embedded member strings inside skiplist nodes. Redis PR #14701 ported #1427 a year and ten days later (merged 2026-01, shipped in 8.6, with the PR description crediting the source), but kept Redis&#x27;s own dict instead of adopting Valkey&#x27;s new hashtable. Measured: Redis 8.6&#x27;s 3.73 GB is essentially on par with Valkey 8.1&#x27;s 3.77 GB, and in the same generation Redis 8.6.7&#x27;s insert throughput (613k/s) is actually higher than Valkey 8.1.10&#x27;s (590k/s); Valkey 9.1.2&#x27;s 3.34 GB (~67 bytes/member) is the smallest measured, vs Redis 8.10.2&#x27;s 3.73 GB (~75 bytes/member). The benchmark author is a Valkey-ecosystem vendor with a position; the workload is a single-ZSET write scenario <code>(third-party statement)</code>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__31": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（Redis 转授权；Valkey fork 承接）。 2024 年 Redis 将 BSD 转为 RSALv2/SSPLv1 双授权，限制云厂商托管，是近年最受关注的协议变更事件。官方文档 Linux 基金会主导 fork 出 Valkey（BSD 3-Clause），AWS、Google 等背书，原 Redis 生态快速迁移。…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（Redis 转授权；Valkey fork 承接）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2024 年 Redis 将 BSD 转为 RSALv2/SSPLv1 双授权，限制云厂商托管，是近年最受关注的协议变更事件。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Linux 基金会主导 fork 出 Valkey（BSD 3-Clause），AWS、Google 等背书，原 Redis 生态快速迁移。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>fork 本身即是风险缓解：Valkey 保持协议开放，但长期治理仍待观察。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Redis moved to RSAL in 2024; Valkey fork carries on). In 2024 Redis moved from BSD to dual RSALv2/SSPLv1 licensing, restricting cloud-vendor hosting — the most w…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Redis moved to RSAL in 2024; Valkey fork carries on).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>In 2024 Redis moved from BSD to dual RSALv2/SSPLv1 licensing, restricting cloud-vendor hosting — the most watched license change in recent years. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>The Linux Foundation-led Valkey fork (BSD 3-Clause), backed by AWS, Google and others, absorbed the Redis ecosystem quickly. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>The fork itself is the mitigation: Valkey stays openly licensed, though long-term governance remains to be seen. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__32": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用（命令式 KV，无查询优化器）。 命令式访问，无查询计划概念 官方文档。 RediSearch 查询有内部优化但非 CBO 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>（命令式 KV，无查询优化器）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>命令式访问，无查询计划概念 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>RediSearch 查询有内部优化但非 CBO <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A (Imperative KV; no query optimizer). Imperative access; no query-plan concept <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. RediSearch queries have internal optimization but no CBO (community con…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> (Imperative KV; no query optimizer).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Imperative access; no query-plan concept <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>RediSearch queries have internal optimization but no CBO <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__33": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（参数少；调优靠内存与持久化）。 redis.conf 参数精简，调优核心是 maxmemory 策略与 RDB/AOF 官方文档。 大 key/慢查询是常规治理项 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（参数少；调优靠内存与持久化）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>redis.conf 参数精简，调优核心是 maxmemory 策略与 RDB/AOF <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>大 key/慢查询是常规治理项 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Few knobs; tune memory and persistence). Lean redis.conf; tuning centers on maxmemory policy and RDB/AOF <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Big keys/slow queries are routine gover…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Few knobs; tune memory and persistence).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Lean redis.conf; tuning centers on maxmemory policy and RDB/AOF <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Big keys/slow queries are routine governance <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redis-valkey__34": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（RDB 无 checksum，AOF 有轻量校验）。 RDB 快照文件无 checksum，损坏常在重启加载时才暴露。社区实测 AOF 文件有多字节校验和，rewrite 与回放时可发现截断/损坏。官方文档 内存损坏无页级防护，主从复制照搬内存状态，坏数据可扩散。社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（RDB 无 checksum，AOF 有轻量校验）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>RDB 快照文件无 checksum，损坏常在重启加载时才暴露。<span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span></li>\n<li>AOF 文件有多字节校验和，rewrite 与回放时可发现截断/损坏。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>内存损坏无页级防护，主从复制照搬内存状态，坏数据可扩散。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (RDB unchecked; AOF lightly checked). RDB snapshot files carry no checksum; corruption often surfaces only on restart load. (community tested) AOF files include a…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (RDB unchecked; AOF lightly checked).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>RDB snapshot files carry no checksum; corruption often surfaces only on restart load. <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n<li>AOF files include a multi-byte checksum, catching truncation/corruption on rewrite and replay. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>No page-level guard for in-memory corruption; replication copies memory state verbatim, so bad data can spread. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>"});